  "releaseNotes": "Treat order commands the same on the SBE and FIX servers\nCarry a stop's or an algo's condition on an SBE replace as a registration carries it\nLet a client tell an SBE server what became of an order\nKnow an order by its id at our own engines, and give the matcher back its resting orders\nServe History storage clients and file transfers over SBE\nCarry the client of an order status request from the gate to the router\nAsk a stop condition for its flavour instead of spelling the key\nMerge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master' into broker-web-designer\nAsk the broker which book a client trades on, instead of remembering\nMerge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master' into broker-web-designer",
